{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組選舉結果陸續公布，商界（第一）17名當選人分別是林健鋒、BRADLEY Guy Martin Coutts、阮蘇少湄、欣榮、霍啟山、李家聰、余國賢、陳豪賢、高美懿、楊美珍、于健安、梁兆基、馮玉麟、伍俊達、陳細明、洪丕正、陳凱。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：羅詠暉\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T13:23:52.141348+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T13:09:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T14:17:23.773615+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T13:17:26.448946+00:00","content_hash":"bdcf8029c9881eab5b1fb284475dec27d847c8abe2751e69f0fe1ed80c1b7455","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}